  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients). Thinly slice pear into wedges. Thinly slice silverbeet.</li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Slice lemon into wedges. Finely chop garlic. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Roughly chop Brie.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-cf138800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and slice mushrooms until tender, 6-8 minutes. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Add herb &amp; mushroom seasoning, garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.</li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Add arborio rice and stir to coat. Add the water (for the rice) and vegetable stock pot. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-d12b3610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Transfer risotto to a baking dish. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-03b8a020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">When risotto has 10 minutes remaining, wash out frying pan and return frying pan to medium-high heat with the butter. </li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Cook pear wedges, turning occasionally, until softened, 2-3 minutes.</li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Reduce heat to medium-low, then carefully add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and water (for the pear) and cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-eca8a730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Remove risotto from oven and stir through the chopped Brie until melted.</li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Stir in silverbeet, a good squeeze of lemon juice, until combined and slightly wilted. Season to taste.</li>\n• <li dir=\"ltr\">Stir through a splash of water to loosen risotto if needed.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-7e9b5440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Divide brie and mushroom risotto between bowls. Top with caramelised pears.</li>\n• <li>Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743b13c30d33981f996a3f/step-f87ce250.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
